  "description": "PDF generation, editing and signing for .NET with no bundled engine, no native binaries and no copyleft. Fill in an invoice and pick a template, lay out flowing documents with tables and pagination, or draw directly, all in pure managed code with embedded TrueType fonts and JPEG/PNG images. Open an existing PDF to draw on its pages, append pages and apply a PAdES digital signature as an incremental update, and verify the signatures a PDF carries. Or render HTML and CSS by driving a Chrome, Edge or Chromium browser already installed on the machine.",
